{"name": "Drone Zone", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80 Steam Next Fest Participant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drone Zone is part of Steam Next Fest! <br/>Download the demo and experience dynamic 5v5 battles with real-time drone progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version launches in April 2026 \u2014 add the game to your wishlist so you don\u2019t miss the release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/408e2835a64744d54dd9a2e10ac69d74.avif?t=1772025237\" width=\"1536\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ACTIVE ABILITIES</strong> <br/>Each drone has a set of active abilities. Immobilize enemies with an energy burst, deploy a field that blocks incoming attacks, summon an anomaly on your target, and use many other powerful skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/c65ab4147b20ca1934043802900901be.poster.avif?t=1772025237\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/c65ab4147b20ca1934043802900901be.webm?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/c65ab4147b20ca1934043802900901be.mp4?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5v5 TEAM BATTLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drone Zone is a tactical team-based online shooter with in-match progression and abilities. Teams of 5 fight to destroy the enemy base or eliminate all opposing drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/b4e3a84eb50a2ba0a3d41be937ea006c.poster.avif?t=1772025237\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/b4e3a84eb50a2ba0a3d41be937ea006c.webm?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/b4e3a84eb50a2ba0a3d41be937ea006c.mp4?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>IN-MATCH PROGRESSION</strong> <br/>Earn experience by defeating enemies and capturing resource nodes. Level up during the match to increase damage, health, and upgrade your drone\u2019s abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/6d2519f13fcf90a52f91d81e4942a1fc.poster.avif?t=1772025237\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/6d2519f13fcf90a52f91d81e4942a1fc.webm?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/6d2519f13fcf90a52f91d81e4942a1fc.mp4?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BOOST YOUR DRONE WITH BATTLE SHOP ITEMS</strong> <br/>In addition to leveling up, you can strengthen your drone by purchasing items with gold earned in battle\u2014boost damage, gain healing effects, reflect damage, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/f890e7dfbe49670d4bad2b3a0040bed0.poster.avif?t=1772025237\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/f890e7dfbe49670d4bad2b3a0040bed0.webm?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/f890e7dfbe49670d4bad2b3a0040bed0.mp4?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TACTICAL FIREFIGHTS</strong> <br/>Destroy enemy modules to limit their strengths. Take out an engine to ground a drone or disable its weapon to stop it from firing. Protect your own modules from enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/78ff2c16af2a887195373ac2edd2a085.poster.avif?t=1772025237\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/78ff2c16af2a887195373ac2edd2a085.webm?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/78ff2c16af2a887195373ac2edd2a085.mp4?t=1772025237\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DRONE ASSEMBLY</strong> <br/>Use gathered resources to craft engines, weapons, batteries, and other modules. Combine them to build your own unique drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/e7c8ca92ace963da76228d7cc5720ec7.avif?t=1772025237\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Multiplayer team-based tactical shooter in a postapocaliptic world. This is not FPV drones. Future. Technology assists in managing flight and targeting. Fight for resources in a world full of hostile anomalies. Use active skills and get advantage depending on which enemy module you have destroyed.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/637fc29b17cde5a394f835a1724d7fa52ae8f516/header.jpg?t=1772025237", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Multiplayer", "Team-Based", "Vehicular Combat", "Massively Multiplayer", "Shooter"], "developers": "Euphoria Machine", "publishers": "Euphoria Machine", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "1311560", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "20 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/qdctPlaGlvU", "first_seen": 1771542000.0, "review_rank": 1152}